ntity matrix ${I}_{3}$ on the *left*, the result must be the $2$nd *row* of $B.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326918 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "547618a0-8326-5c69-a8a6-90946d345819" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186324672} {:answer/id #uuid "92b611b4-1de1-54e3-8e47-c6d9afcf6391" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325217} {:answer/id #uuid "ca07b3d1-2a80-507e-b285-fa340e7564d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{2} & \\sqrt{5} & -3.2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325723} {:answer/id #uuid "d9140d70-3d89-572c-9b7a-363941c8d8ee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -3.2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325859} {:answer/id #uuid "dcf09920-2631-5ae0-a559-366a99a9aae2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{6} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325898}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ca07b3d1-2a80-507e-b285-fa340e7564d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2\\sqrt{2} & \\sqrt{5} & -3.2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186325723} :answer-field/id #uuid "d2c066b6-6111-554a-8ecd-ea29f447cd40" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186326602}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/mode