\\sqrt{5})\\cdot 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3.5 \\\\ -4\\sqrt{5}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Matrix by a Column or Row of the Identity Matrix"}]}
